  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eradicating violence against women and girls - Guatemala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme enhances mechanisms for prevention, protection and response to violence against indigenous and marginalized women and girls in Guatemala. It comprises legal, medical and psychosocial victim assistance; advocacy work; capacity building for service providers and awareness raising. It also strengthens our partners; MTM and five indigenous women&#xB4;s CSOs.</narrative>
  </description>
